{"title":"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32afc7225de40c3a57d8ecea5499991185fbab9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{24} = \\frac{4}{x + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"94\" height=\"40\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cross multiplying, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efee8a70a81d7271eed64f078e2dda255608ac1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8(x + 3) = 24 \\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/a/afa58b5821ad250d028cc9ba3021abcf1b930309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x + 8 \\times 3 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/8/a780525d8c7cdd299b542f6b3b800db6426450ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x + 24 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/dea97b64c3ea4000ca165f01370a87367561f773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x = 96 - 24 = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/300196c1bebf9e3e515e8ee5ba660211f3b1f653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{72}{8} = \\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c22db6584d412d3bedf39ea14121e8ff70de2b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{24} = \\frac{8 \\div 2}{24 \\div 2} = \\frac{4}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" />. This is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/d/f6d0fadd66e317f95b56b68b2b829d0cc0e38115.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{x + 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" />, which has the same numerator as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8deb72d8c8f0ef7a7d011f95becfbb01a3d4ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" />, so the denominators are equal. \n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/066ec33d093d3074acb14799d9229a9335b833f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4f3c413ef783408f43d2b4784cfbb58119092b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12 - 3 = \\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"131\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC\" title=\"2015 CSMC\">2015 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018060744\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1240/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2297/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.963      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    6.963      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37300:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018060744 and revision id 287959. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}